    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so heavy. like everything is just... meant to be this way. the silence you're talking about sounds almost better than this constant noise of being told i'm nothing. if it's actually okay to just let go, then maybe the fight is just a way to keep hurting myself. what does it even mean to \"find peace\" when everything is so broken?",
